          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "aufpumpen is built from auf 'up' and pumpen, from Pumpe 'pump', a seafarers' word that EtymDB traces to Middle Low German pumpe; its deeper origin is not settled."
            }
